  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Tokenized stocks distributed value rose 7.1% over 30D:</strong> Tokenized equity distributed value at $3.73B (7.1% higher over 30D) shows the early lane still adding balance sheet on a small set of platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/11/06/solana-lset-for-its-first-tokenized-stock-venue-under-sec-framework-listing-galaxy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Solana set for its first tokenized stock venue under SEC framework, listing Galaxy</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Tokenized stocks remain an early-stage lane:</strong> liquidity and scale are still concentrated in a small set of platforms/networks. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxPck1LRDZNWV9weVczeHVQX20zWXF6bVVTWF9uUmpFT1JRb0JoSWV1M3Q0Z1JlZkVJODNXbmo3M2FfMWJqMmkyWWhHZnZ0ZzFJVjZ0aGQxa3JCSVo0VkZTNzBNWUczUGF2Z20zZ2taR1J4V3dFeUpZeXZRR0xtT3VmblJIZGFzUkY3RHdKc3RLeVVPTXRsZGpEMDRQV3JlN1A3MUIzbW1mSlBkMEZVVXRreVdzbE1hdzZKeTRDUjdkeDJPM3JlWXFjVQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Exclusive: New tokenized stock venue eyes 2027 Solana launch</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Tokenized equities remain an early access market:</strong> Liquidity and scale stay concentrated until broker distribution and custody plumbing can support broader trading. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-11-09-nyse-settle-tokenized-stocks-avalanche-planned-24-7-market-436208\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NYSE to settle tokenized stocks on Avalanche in planned 24/7 market</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Securities and broker-rule constraints often set the pace more than listing count, so near-term share stays tied to venues that can actually distribute products. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/formation-securities-solana-stock-trading-venue-sec-exemption?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Formation Securities plans Solana stock trading venue under SEC exemption</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
